%T A399261 12180,14880,163680,25308,34440,39732,51888,117600,74412,102660,
%U A399261 113460,1572480,150348,178920,194472,246480,1062720,285852,352440,456288,515100,546312,612468
%N A399261 Order of the projective special semilinear group PSigmaL_2(K), where K is the finite field with q = A246655(n) elements.
%C A399261 The projective special semilinear group of degree 2 over K, denoted PSigmaL_2(K) or PSigmaL(2,q), is the quotient of SigmaL_2(K) by the center of SL_2(K), and SigmaL_2(K) is the semidirect product of SL_2(K) and Aut(K).
%H A399261 Groupprops, <a href="https://groupprops.subwiki.org/wiki/Order_formulas_for_linear_groups">Order formulas for linear groups</a>.
%F A399261 For q = p^r, |PSigmaL(2,q)| = r*q*(q^2-1) / gcd(2,q).
%o A399261 (PARI)
%o A399261 [(q+1)*q*(q-1)*isprimepower(q)/gcd(2,q-1) | q <- [1..200], isprimepower(q)]
%Y A399261 Order of SL(2,q): A329119;
%Y A399261 PGammaL(2,q) and SigmaL(2,q): A352807;
%Y A399261 GammaL(2,q): A399260.
%K A399261 nonn,new
%O A399261 1,1
